    "body": "> The following styles are [expected](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#expected) to apply to [select](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#the-select-element) elements when they are being rendered as a [drop-down box](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#drop-down-box) with [native appearance](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#native-appearance) or [primitive appearance](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#primitive-appearance):\r\n> \r\n> ```css\r\n> @namespace \"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\";\r\n> \r\n> select {\r\n>   display: inline-block;\r\n> }\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nI did this but trimmed out the appearance thing since I think this should apply regardless of appearance probably, see https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14319.\r\n\r\nIf you object to that I'm happy to reintroduce it tho.",
